        "created_at": "2016-04-07T04:53:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I sent an email a few days ago but haven’t gotten a response yet. My girlfriend backed the oblivaeon kickstarter for us on her account, but we didn’t realize until the darkwatch update why we didn’t have our survey yet: it’s attached to an old email we no longer have access to.</p>\n<p>Does anybody know of a way I can get this fixed? We backed for pretty much everything new as longtime fans, and while being out the money would suck, being out the product would suck even more…</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:13.948Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
